# Conformance probe pack for a failed check at an inner line reached after a
# transform-decode (spec 0.34, Reaching the inner line): an ascii field that
# can fail, then an inner line naming a format no pack declares. Most
# significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   byte 0      s1, one ascii character
#   the rest    a conformance-inner-not-a-format message (unknown-format)
format     conformance-inner-asciimissing
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  8  ascii
inner   conformance-inner-not-a-format
